research/audit/wave2-impact-audit.json-2916-      "notes": "Material root(s): def-product-topology, lem-finite-set-has-max, rem-sup-conventions. Root def-product-topology: a Remark asserted that the product and box topologies differ for infinite index sets without the Axiom of Choice hypothesis its cited theorem now carries. The qualification was added. The Definition is unchanged. Root lem-finite-set-has-max: a Remark falsely claimed no published item cites this lemma (117 published items list it in deps). The claim was replaced with durable prose, and Alpha removed a residual consumer claim. The Statement and the induction are unchanged, so all 117 consumers remain licensed by exactly what they cited. Root rem-sup-conventions: a promise that a later page would introduce the extended real line was replaced by a statement of fact, recorded as a forward reference and not a deps edge. The conventions it fixes are unchanged. Alpha read this consumer’s use of each material root from disk: no fact, numbered step or Statement of this item relies on the text that changed, so its citation remains licensed."
